\caption{Effect of SDF loss weight $\lambda$ on CAR and TSR for Pi0.5 with LoRA fine-tuning. The $\lambda = 0$ point corresponds to LoRA-only (no SDF). \placeholder{Pending: $\lambda = 0.1$ results.}}
\label{fig:lambda_car}
